WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Register your components, their Variants, and their Actions.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
The user asks, “Show today and my tasks.” The client sends intent and the current UI to the Engine.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
The Engine returns a layout and an execution plan. First, the client applies the layout.

00:15.000 --> 00:21.000
The client runs showDay(today). The calendar changes to the Today view.

00:21.000 --> 00:26.000
Your components stay interactive. The UI follows intent.
